# The suite is product evidence: `npm test` is only meaningful if the tests are
# in the repository, so tests/ is versioned.

# Documentation: the plan/report markdown is versioned, the generated artefacts
# (docx, pdf, html, emoji pngs) that sit beside it are not.
docs/*
!docs/*.md
docs/assets/
